  3000  convolution: exactly the union
  3000  sum: intersection inside, symmetric difference outside
  3000  reduction: the pattern cut down
  3000  lift: divisors of N kept exactly
  3000  dilation: exactly {d : d/gcd(d,c) in pattern(B)}
  3000  stacking: divisors of c and the common ones are in; size c w
   151     sum: a divisor outside both came in
   205     lift: a divisor not dividing N came in
    71     stacking: another divisor came in
